{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國勁爆女團BLACK PINK泰籍成員Lisa今日發行全新個人迷你專輯《PRESS PLAY》，繼早前率先公開的新歌《SaWaDiKa》，今日發布了收錄在新碟中的另一首單曲《Tarantino》MV。她在MV中化身性感特務，穿梭於酒店大堂、客房與廚房等多個場景，展開高能激烈的打鬥與動作戲，展現強大氣場，向荷里活鬼才導演昆頓塔倫天奴（Quentin Tarantino）致敬。MV與歌曲概念深受對方的經典電影與暴力美學風格啟發，上架短短一個半小時便火速吸百萬點擊！</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:23:57.664989+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":241,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:39:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.289909+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:10.204861+00:00","content_hash":"aeda63bf5201c036b6d6546935d6dea4151cad37b0987ec829976ce42532cccc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:23:57.664989+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}